# CatDex — Missions & XP

## XP / levels

- Logic: `src/lib/progression.ts` — `xpForCat`, `estimateTotalXp`, level curves, `MAX_LEVEL`, quests/collections helpers
- Reward UI should **animate XP** (`XpTicker` / progress), not only show static `+N XP`

## Missions

- Store: `useMissionsStore` (persist + streak)
- UI: `src/components/missions/*`, tab `missions`
- Starter mission energy: first capture — keep achievable early

## Rules

- Progression must remain explainable (no opaque random XP swings)
- Don’t soft-lock the map behind unfinished missions
- When adding missions, define clear completion predicates tied to real player actions (capture, count, streak)
- Profile surfaces can summarize level/XP using shared progression helpers — don’t reimplement curves in UI
